      <span class="arr">→</span>
    </a>
    <a class="r-card" href="https://www.thebalancemoney.com/top-business-skills-2063738" target="_blank">
      <div class="r-card-tag">Skills</div>
      <h3>Essential Business Skills for Early-Career Professionals</h3>
      <p>A comprehensive guide to the financial, communication, and strategic skills every future leader needs.</p>
