    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="r-section-title">Entrepreneurship</p>
  <div class="r-grid">
    <a class="r-card" href="https://www.score.org/resource/women-entrepreneurship" target="_blank">
      <div class="r-card-tag">SCORE</div>
      <h3>Women Entrepreneurship Resources</h3>
